  "title": "· New Bags · GUCCI Unveils Japan-Exclusive Bamboo 1947 Top-Handle Bag and Small Leather Goods Featuring 'Shippo-yaki' Enamel Craft",
  "original_title": "新包 | GUCCI 推出日本限定款 Bamboo 1947 竹节包和小皮具：「七宝烧」工艺",
  "excerpt": "Gucci collaborates with Japanese workshop Ando Cloisonné on a limited capsule featuring cloisonné floral motifs on handbags.",
  "author": "撰稿 X Vivi 编辑 X RAN",
  "date_iso": "2026-07-10",
  "date_label": "July 10, 2026",
  "cover_image": "https://fa9d97a1fc25607f898b44b0ebb78880.r2.cloudflarestorage.com/luxbagblog/images/jtkxr51/07d9ac3eb9aa9e39.jpg",
  "tags": [
    "GUCCI"
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "GUCCI has teamed up with the legendary Japanese cloisonné workshop**Ando Cloisonné**on a limited-edition capsule collection. Using the traditional *shippo-yaki* (cloisonné) technique, intricate floral motifs like lilies and roses adorn the Bamboo 1947 top-handle bag and small leather goods. The lustrous enamel and lacquered leather create a captivating interplay, infusing the pieces with an elegant Eastern charm.",
      "url": null,
      "full_url": null,
      "alt": null,
      "columns": 2,
      "items": []
    },
